-- Crafting trainers teach every trainer recipe, at the right skill (Four, 2026-11-15). Run against bfa_world.
--
-- Found: Karn Stonehoof (Thunder Bluff) and most crafting trainers use HavenCore-made lists (991 Blacksmithing,
-- 993 Engineering, 990 Leatherworking, 122 Alchemy, 119 Jewelcrafting, ...) whose skill requirements are the
-- recipe's yellow skill instead of the level it is learned at (Rough Grinding Stone 45 instead of 25, Copper
-- Chain Pants 50 instead of 1), so at Blacksmithing 44 those recipes did not show. Those lists also had no
-- Outland, Northrend or Pandaria recipes (Jewelcrafting list 119: 27 Classic recipes, nothing else). Blizzard's
-- own 8.0 lists that are in the dump (27 Blacksmithing, 62 Enchanting, 407 Engineering, 63 Inscription,
-- 29 Jewelcrafting, 56 Leatherworking, 163 Tailoring, 136 Cooking) are complete but ask for the old
-- profession skill on the old scale (Blacksmithing 350 for a Northrend recipe), which the expansion skills
-- never reach.
--
-- Changed: every trainer list that teaches a profession's Classic skill now teaches that profession's full set
-- of Classic to Pandaria trainer recipes, each requiring its own expansion skill (Classic Blacksmithing 2477,
-- Northrend Blacksmithing 2475, ...) at the level it is learned at:
--   - recipe set and Classic levels: Blizzard's 8.0 list above; for Alchemy (no Blizzard list in the dump)
--     the Mists of Pandaria 5.4.8 trainer data, kept only where the 8.3.7 client still has the recipe;
--   - expansion levels on the 1-75 scale: old level minus 300 (Outland), 375 (Northrend), 450 (Cataclysm),
--     525 (Pandaria), at least 1. Blizzard's own 8.0 rows for Cataclysm recipes use exactly old minus 450;
--   - Pandaria cooking (Sungshin Ironpaw's list 582): level 1, as the 8.3.7 client rates them;
--   - cost: the highest cost any source lists; no level requirement.
--   Alchemy          135 recipes (Classic 43, Outland 12, Northrend 35, Cataclysm 42, Pandaria 3)
--   Blacksmithing    240 recipes (Classic 82, Outland 15, Northrend 92, Cataclysm 35, Pandaria 16)
--   Cooking           61 recipes (Classic 20, Outland 3, Northrend 16, Cataclysm 2, Pandaria 20)
--   Enchanting       185 recipes (Classic 63, Outland 18, Northrend 39, Cataclysm 35, Pandaria 30)
--   Engineering      225 recipes (Classic 80, Outland 36, Northrend 43, Cataclysm 30, Pandaria 36)
--   Inscription      139 recipes (Classic 54, Outland 8, Northrend 22, Cataclysm 26, Pandaria 29)
--   Jewelcrafting    253 recipes (Classic 49, Outland 26, Northrend 62, Cataclysm 38, Pandaria 78)
--   Leatherworking   270 recipes (Classic 108, Outland 33, Northrend 73, Cataclysm 30, Pandaria 26)
--   Tailoring        227 recipes (Classic 103, Outland 8, Northrend 62, Cataclysm 40, Pandaria 14)
-- Draenor and Legion recipes are not sold by trainers (garrison, quests); Kul Tiran rows are untouched.
-- Also: Sungshin Ironpaw (64231) opened the old fallback list and now opens list 582.
--
-- Each list's rows for these recipes are deleted first, so the file is safe to run more than once.

DELETE FROM `creature_trainer` WHERE `CreatureId` = 64231 AND `MenuId` = 0 AND `OptionIndex` = 3;

